# 主题对比样板图：垂心、垂足三角形与欧拉线
~triangle A B C
H 165 = orthocenter A B C
O 15 = circumcenter A B C
D 270 = foot A B C
E 30 = foot B C A
F 150 = foot C A B
!check_perp(A, D, B, C, "AD perp BC");

circumcircle A B C / circ
A--B--C--cycle / fill1 / given
D--E--F--cycle / fill2 / circ2
A--D / aux
B--E / aux
C--F / aux
O--H / key
rightanglemark A D C / mark
